  ('quant', 'Ratio', 1, '₹11,000 is divided between Asha and Ben in the ratio 6:5. What is the larger share?', array['₹9,000', '₹6,000', '₹5,000', '₹5,500'], 1, 'Total parts = 6 + 5 = 11. One part = ₹11,000 ÷ 11 = ₹1,000. The larger share is 6 × ₹1,000 = ₹6,000.', 30, 'ratio_share', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ratio', 1, '₹21,450 is divided between Asha and Ben in the ratio 5:8. What is the larger share?', array['₹10,725', '₹8,250', '₹13,200', '₹9,900'], 2, 'Total parts = 5 + 8 = 13. One part = ₹21,450 ÷ 13 = ₹1,650. The larger share is 8 × ₹1,650 = ₹13,200.', 30, 'ratio_share', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ratio', 1, '₹1,200 is divided between Asha and Ben in the ratio 7:1. What is the smaller share?', array['₹450', '₹600', '₹1,050', '₹150'], 3, 'Total parts = 7 + 1 = 8. One part = ₹1,200 ÷ 8 = ₹150. The smaller share is 1 × ₹150 = ₹150.', 30, 'ratio_share', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ratio', 1, '₹7,500 is divided between Asha and Ben in the ratio 2:3. What is the smaller share?', array['₹3,750', '₹6,000', '₹4,500', '₹3,000'], 3, 'Total parts = 2 + 3 = 5. One part = ₹7,500 ÷ 5 = ₹1,500. The smaller share is 2 × ₹1,500 = ₹3,000.', 30, 'ratio_share', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ratio', 1, '₹8,250 is divided between Asha and Ben in the ratio 3:2. What is the larger share?', array['₹4,125', '₹9,900', '₹4,950', '₹3,300'], 2, 'Total parts = 3 + 2 = 5. One part = ₹8,250 ÷ 5 = ₹1,650. The larger share is 3 × ₹1,650 = ₹4,950.', 30, 'ratio_share', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ratio', 1, '₹9,100 is divided between Asha and Ben in the ratio 5:2. What is the larger share?', array['₹6,500', '₹4,550', '₹2,600', '₹9,100'], 0, 'Total parts = 5 + 2 = 7. One part = ₹9,100 ÷ 7 = ₹1,300. The larger share is 5 × ₹1,300 = ₹6,500.', 30, 'ratio_share', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 8:3. After 5 years, the ratio will be 9:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['40 years', '45 years', '35 years', '15 years'], 0, 'Let the ages be 8x and 3x. Then 4(8x + 5) = 9(3x + 5), which gives x = 5. Priya is 8 × 5 = 40 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 4:3. After 3 years, the ratio will be 11:9. What is Priya''s present age?', array['11 years', '8 years', '10 years', '6 years'], 1, 'Let the ages be 4x and 3x. Then 9(4x + 3) = 11(3x + 3), which gives x = 2. Priya is 4 × 2 = 8 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 9:4. After 12 years, the ratio will be 3:2. What is Priya''s present age?', array['18 years', '20 years', '30 years', '8 years'], 0, 'Let the ages be 9x and 4x. Then 2(9x + 12) = 3(4x + 12), which gives x = 2. Priya is 9 × 2 = 18 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 8:3. After 4 years, the ratio will be 9:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['12 years', '28 years', '32 years', '36 years'], 2, 'Let the ages be 8x and 3x. Then 4(8x + 4) = 9(3x + 4), which gives x = 4. Priya is 8 × 4 = 32 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:4. After 12 years, the ratio will be 11:8. What is Priya''s present age?', array['24 years', '33 years', '21 years', '12 years'], 2, 'Let the ages be 7x and 4x. Then 8(7x + 12) = 11(4x + 12), which gives x = 3. Priya is 7 × 3 = 21 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 5:2. After 3 years, the ratio will be 13:7. What is Priya''s present age?', array['10 years', '12 years', '4 years', '13 years'], 0, 'Let the ages be 5x and 2x. Then 7(5x + 3) = 13(2x + 3), which gives x = 2. Priya is 5 × 2 = 10 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 4:1. After 15 years, the ratio will be 7:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['25 years', '5 years', '20 years', '35 years'], 2, 'Let the ages be 4x and 1x. Then 4(4x + 15) = 7(1x + 15), which gives x = 5. Priya is 4 × 5 = 20 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:2. After 8 years, the ratio will be 9:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['28 years', '32 years', '8 years', '36 years'], 0, 'Let the ages be 7x and 2x. Then 4(7x + 8) = 9(2x + 8), which gives x = 4. Priya is 7 × 4 = 28 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:2. After 6 years, the ratio will be 9:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['27 years', '24 years', '6 years', '21 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 7x and 2x. Then 4(7x + 6) = 9(2x + 6), which gives x = 3. Priya is 7 × 3 = 21 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:5. After 6 years, the ratio will be 5:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['14 years', '10 years', '16 years', '20 years'], 0, 'Let the ages be 7x and 5x. Then 4(7x + 6) = 5(5x + 6), which gives x = 2. Priya is 7 × 2 = 14 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:2. After 14 years, the ratio will be 7:3. What is Priya''s present age?', array['16 years', '56 years', '64 years', '70 years'], 1, 'Let the ages be 7x and 2x. Then 3(7x + 14) = 7(2x + 14), which gives x = 8. Priya is 7 × 8 = 56 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:5. After 11 years, the ratio will be 16:13. What is Priya''s present age?', array['32 years', '24 years', '21 years', '15 years'], 2, 'Let the ages be 7x and 5x. Then 13(7x + 11) = 16(5x + 11), which gives x = 3. Priya is 7 × 3 = 21 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 67^365?', array['7', '9', '3', '1'], 0, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 7 end in 7, 9, 3, 1, repeating every 4. 365 is position 1 in that cycle (365 ÷ 4 leaves 1), so the unit digit is 7.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 92^866?', array['6', '4', '2', '8'], 1, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 2 end in 2, 4, 8, 6, repeating every 4. 866 is position 2 in that cycle (866 ÷ 4 leaves 2), so the unit digit is 4.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 79^381?', array['8', '4', '1', '9'], 3, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 9 end in 9, 1, repeating every 2. 381 is position 1 in that cycle (381 ÷ 2 leaves 1), so the unit digit is 9.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 69^356?', array['7', '1', '2', '9'], 1, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 9 end in 9, 1, repeating every 2. 356 is position 2 in that cycle (356 ÷ 2 leaves 0), so the unit digit is 1.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 9^370?', array['2', '1', '9', '7'], 1, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 9 end in 9, 1, repeating every 2. 370 is position 2 in that cycle (370 ÷ 2 leaves 0), so the unit digit is 1.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 78^997?', array['6', '4', '2', '8'], 3, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 8 end in 8, 4, 2, 6, repeating every 4. 997 is position 1 in that cycle (997 ÷ 4 leaves 1), so the unit digit is 8.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 18^540?', array['4', '6', '8', '2'], 1, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 8 end in 8, 4, 2, 6, repeating every 4. 540 is position 4 in that cycle (540 ÷ 4 leaves 0), so the unit digit is 6.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 83^774?', array['7', '1', '3', '9'], 3, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 3 end in 3, 9, 7, 1, repeating every 4. 774 is position 2 in that cycle (774 ÷ 4 leaves 2), so the unit digit is 9.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 33^672?', array['3', '9', '7', '1'], 3, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 3 end in 3, 9, 7, 1, repeating every 4. 672 is position 4 in that cycle (672 ÷ 4 leaves 0), so the unit digit is 1.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 43^861?', array['1', '3', '9', '7'], 1, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 3 end in 3, 9, 7, 1, repeating every 4. 861 is position 1 in that cycle (861 ÷ 4 leaves 1), so the unit digit is 3.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 47^762?', array['9', '7', '1', '3'], 0, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 7 end in 7, 9, 3, 1, repeating every 4. 762 is position 2 in that cycle (762 ÷ 4 leaves 2), so the unit digit is 9.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Number System', 2, 'What is the unit digit of 7^27?', array['7', '3', '9', '1'], 1, 'Only the last digit matters. Powers of 7 end in 7, 9, 3, 1, repeating every 4. 27 is position 3 in that cycle (27 ÷ 4 leaves 3), so the unit digit is 3.', 40, 'unit_digit', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'LCM & HCF', 2, 'Three bells ring at intervals of 4, 30 and 45 minutes. They ring together at 8:00 AM. When will they next ring together?', array['9:30 AM', '11:00 AM', '2:00 PM', '9:19 AM'], 1, 'They ring together every LCM(4, 30, 45) = 180 minutes. 8:00 AM + 180 minutes = 11:00 AM.', 40, 'bells_lcm', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'LCM & HCF', 2, 'Three bells ring at intervals of 6, 20 and 24 minutes. They ring together at 8:00 AM. When will they next ring together?', array['8:50 AM', '12:00 PM', '10:00 AM', '9:00 AM'], 2, 'They ring together every LCM(6, 20, 24) = 120 minutes. 8:00 AM + 120 minutes = 10:00 AM.', 40, 'bells_lcm', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'LCM & HCF', 2, 'Three bells ring at intervals of 10, 15 and 16 minutes. They ring together at 10:00 AM. When will they next ring together?', array['12:00 PM', '6:00 PM', '2:00 PM', '10:41 AM'], 2, 'They ring together every LCM(10, 15, 16) = 240 minutes. 10:00 AM + 240 minutes = 2:00 PM.', 40, 'bells_lcm', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'LCM & HCF', 2, 'Three bells ring at intervals of 8, 15 and 20 minutes. They ring together at 8:00 AM. When will they next ring together?', array['8:43 AM', '10:00 AM', '9:00 AM', '12:00 PM'], 1, 'They ring together every LCM(8, 15, 20) = 120 minutes. 8:00 AM + 120 minutes = 10:00 AM.', 40, 'bells_lcm', null, null, null),
